/Title (Here MODIS shows us that Croplands occupy 15981sqkm \(97.8%\) out of 16340sqkm \(total area of Udaipur and Rajsamand\). Since MODIS is very low resolution data, at 500m, it is clubbing together all smaller patches of lands \(grasslands,shrublands\) together under cropland. The data is signifying that very few big parcels of land \(25,000sqm\) would classify as only grassland and shrubland and most smaller parcels of what could be shrubland or grazing land are being clubbed under croplands> This also might signify extensive human cover to commodify all open grasslands and shrublands under cropland or being located very near to it.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1584 0 R
/Next 1550 0 R
>>
endobj
